<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>AIメモリーいらんかえ～ Plugin Marketplace</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>AIメモリーいらんかえ～</h1>
  <p>Agent plugin marketplace</p>
  <p><code>{{ plugin_public_url }}</code></p>

  <h2>Claude Code</h2>
  <pre>/plugin marketplace add {{ plugin_public_url }}/marketplace.json
/plugin install ai-memory@hackathon-ai-memory</pre>
  <p>Then set <code>AI_MEMORY_API_KEY</code>.</p>

  <h2>Cursor</h2>
  <p>Download and install the plugin zip locally:</p>
  <pre>curl -fsSL "{{ plugin_public_url }}/plugins/ai-memory.zip" -o ai-memory.zip
mkdir -p ~/.cursor/plugins/local
unzip -o ai-memory.zip -d ~/.cursor/plugins/local
# Restart Cursor / Reload Window, then set AI_MEMORY_API_KEY</pre>
  <p>Marketplace manifest (for Team Marketplace / local clone):
    <a href="{{ plugin_public_url }}/.cursor-plugin/marketplace.json"><code>.cursor-plugin/marketplace.json</code></a>
  </p>

  <h2>Gemini CLI</h2>
  <pre>curl -fsSL "{{ plugin_public_url }}/plugins/ai-memory.zip" -o ai-memory.zip
unzip -o ai-memory.zip -d /tmp
gemini extensions install /tmp/ai-memory</pre>
  <p>On install, set the <strong>AI Memory API key</strong> (<code>AI_MEMORY_API_KEY</code>).</p>

  <h2>Recommended skill</h2>
  <p>
    Also install <strong>elasticsearch-esql</strong> from
    <a href="https://github.com/elastic/agent-skills">elastic/agent-skills</a>.
    It is recommended for ES|QL search and aggregation alongside this plugin.
  </p>
  <pre>npx skills add elastic/agent-skills --skill elasticsearch-esql</pre>
  <p>Claude Code (marketplace + Elasticsearch plugin, includes elasticsearch-esql):</p>
  <pre>claude plugin marketplace add https://github.com/elastic/agent-skills
claude plugin install elastic-elasticsearch@elastic-agent-skills</pre>

  <h2>Artifacts</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="{{ plugin_public_url }}/marketplace.json">Claude marketplace.json</a></li>
    <li><a href="{{ plugin_public_url }}/.claude-plugin/marketplace.json">.claude-plugin/marketplace.json</a></li>
    <li><a href="{{ plugin_public_url }}/.cursor-plugin/marketplace.json">.cursor-plugin/marketplace.json</a></li>
    <li><a href="{{ plugin_public_url }}/plugins/ai-memory.zip">plugins/ai-memory.zip</a></li>
  </ul>

  <p><strong>Caution:</strong> Hackathon-grade security only. Do not store personal or confidential data.</p>
</body>
</html>
